{
  "sections": {
    "breadcrumbs": {
      "type": "breadcrumbs",
      "settings": {
        "container": "fixed",
        "text_alignment": "start",
        "padding_top": 16,
        "padding_bottom": 20
      }
    },
    "main": {
      "type": "main-product",
      "blocks": {
        "ss_badge": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<span class=\"ss-pdp-badge\">Le cœur du rituel Nomade</span>"
          }
        },
        "title": {
          "type": "title",
          "settings": {
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "price": {
          "type": "price",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "description": {
          "type": "description",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "ss_facts": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"ss-pdp-facts\"><div><b>Compatibilité</b>Coque de diffusion Nomade (format Mini)</div><div><b>Inclus</b>Un disque sédiment dans chaque sachet, à changer avec la capsule</div><div><b>Durée d&#x27;utilisation</b>10 à 15 jours selon ta fréquence de douche</div></div>"
          }
        },
        "variant_picker": {
          "type": "variant_picker",
          "settings": {
            "picker_type": "button",
            "swatch_type": "shopify_swatch",
            "swatch_style": "circle",
            "swatch_size": 32,
            "button_style": "normal",
            "size_title": "Size",
            "size_chart_from_page": ""
          }
        },
        "ss_offers": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{% render 'ss-offers', product: product, section_id: section.id, tiers: '1:0,2:5,4:10,6:15', singular: \"capsule\", plural: \"capsules\", title: \"Choisis ta quantité\" %}"
          }
        },
        "buy_buttons": {
          "type": "buy_buttons",
          "settings": {
            "show_quantity_selector": true,
            "show_dynamic_checkout": false,
            "show_gift_card_recipient": false
          }
        },
        "reassurance": {
          "type": "icon-with-text",
          "settings": {
            "layout": "vertical",
            "title_font": "body",
            "title_size": "text-base",
            "icon_1": "check",
            "heading_1": "<strong>Sélection Sunsoari</strong> : marques choisies avec exigence",
            "icon_2": "truck",
            "heading_2": "<strong>Livraison suivie</strong> en France métropolitaine",
            "icon_3": "check",
            "heading_3": "<strong>Paiement sécurisé</strong> : CB, Apple Pay, PayPal"
          }
        },
        "acc_3": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Composition",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Les actifs annoncés par la marque sont présentés plus bas, dans « Ce que contient ta capsule ». La liste complète des ingrédients (INCI) de chaque senteur figure sur l'emballage.</p><p>Usage externe uniquement, dans le système Onsha compatible. Tenir hors de portée des enfants. Conçu en Corée.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "default_open": false,
            "show_below_product_media": false
          }
        },
        "sticky_atc": {
          "type": "sticky-atc-bar",
          "settings": {
            "visibility": "all",
            "style": "minimalist",
            "container": "full",
            "show_atc_button": true,
            "show_dynamic_checkout_buttons": false,
            "show_quantity": true
          }
        },
        "ss_complements": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{% render 'ss-complements', items: \"coque-de-diffusion-nomade||Accueille ta capsule;douchette-filtrante||La douchette du rituel Nomade\", title: \"La capsule est vendue seule\", note: \"Elle s'insère dans la coque de diffusion Nomade, fixée à la douchette filtrante. Pas encore équipée ?\" %}"
          }
        },
        "ss_rating": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{% render 'ss-rating', product: product %}"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ss_badge",
        "title",
        "ss_rating",
        "price",
        "description",
        "variant_picker",
        "ss_offers",
        "buy_buttons",
        "ss_complements",
        "ss_facts",
        "reassurance",
        "acc_3",
        "sticky_atc"
      ],
      "custom_css": [
        "@media (min-width: 1280px) {.product {padding-inline: 5rem; }}"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "use_color_scheme_in_container": false,
        "enable_sticky_info": true,
        "media_size": "large",
        "gallery_layout": "vertical-carousel",
        "mobile_thumbnails": "show",
        "show_image_border": false,
        "enable_image_zoom": true,
        "enable_video_looping": true,
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 40
      }
    },
    "ss_steps": {
      "type": "ss-story",
      "blocks": {
        "b1": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<strong>Ouvre</strong> la coque de diffusion Nomade."
          }
        },
        "b2": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<strong>Retire</strong> la capsule vide et son disque sédiment."
          }
        },
        "b3": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<strong>Insère</strong> la nouvelle capsule avec son disque."
          }
        },
        "b4": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<strong>Referme</strong> : ton rituel reprend."
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "b1",
        "b2",
        "b3",
        "b4"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "layout": "steps",
        "background": "white",
        "align": "center",
        "eyebrow": "Mode d'emploi",
        "heading": "Remplace ta capsule en 5 secondes",
        "text": "",
        "columns": 3,
        "columns_mobile": "1",
        "ratio": "1/1",
        "open_first": false,
        "tip_title": "Les conseils de l'équipe",
        "tip_text": "<p>Varie les senteurs selon tes envies : Océan ou Forêt de Pin le matin, Hinoki ou Fleur de Prunier le soir.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Copie_de_IMG_2103.gif"
      }
    },
    "ss_scents": {
      "type": "ss-story",
      "blocks": {
        "b1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Hinoki",
            "text": "<p>Cyprès, bois chaud, musc doux. Idéale le soir, pour ralentir.</p>",
            "tag": "Calme absolu",
            "link_label": "",
            "show_price": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/onsha-capsule-thermale-vitaminee-5877420.jpg"
          }
        },
        "b2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Océan",
            "text": "<p>Embruns marins, sel minéral, végétal aquatique. Parfaite le matin.</p>",
            "tag": "Fraîcheur marine",
            "link_label": "",
            "show_price": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/onsha-capsule-thermale-vitaminee-2207031.jpg"
          }
        },
        "b3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Forêt de Pin",
            "text": "<p>Pin frais, résine, terre humide. Tonique dès le réveil.</p>",
            "tag": "Énergie des forêts",
            "link_label": "",
            "show_price": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/onsha-capsule-thermale-vitaminee-4674867.jpg"
          }
        },
        "b4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Fleur de Prunier",
            "text": "<p>Fleur de prunier, poudré doux, bois blanc. Apaisante et délicate.</p>",
            "tag": "Douceur florale",
            "link_label": "",
            "show_price": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/capsule-vitaminee-3625758.jpg"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "b1",
        "b2",
        "b3",
        "b4"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "layout": "cards",
        "background": "cream",
        "align": "center",
        "eyebrow": "Choisis ton ambiance",
        "heading": "Nos quatre senteurs",
        "text": "",
        "columns": 4,
        "columns_mobile": "2",
        "ratio": "4/5",
        "open_first": false
      }
    },
    "ss_cards": {
      "type": "ss-story",
      "blocks": {
        "b1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Eau thermale soufrée",
            "text": "<p>Selon la marque, puisée à 808 m dans le granit coréen, lyophilisée puis concentrée 4 fois.</p>",
            "tag": "Minéral",
            "link_label": "",
            "show_price": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ambiance-eau-thermale-bain-carre.jpg"
          }
        },
        "b2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Vitamine C",
            "text": "<p>Ingrédient phare des filtres de douche coréens.</p>",
            "tag": "Vitaminé",
            "link_label": "",
            "show_price": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ingredient-vitamine-c-citron-bulles-eau.jpg"
          }
        },
        "b3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Acide hyaluronique et glycérine",
            "text": "<p>Deux actifs classiques des soins hydratants.</p>",
            "tag": "Hydratant",
            "link_label": "",
            "show_price": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ingredient-acide-hyaluronique-gel-bulles.jpg"
          }
        },
        "b4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Senteur des régions thermales",
            "text": "<p>Quatre ambiances inspirées des régions thermales coréennes.</p>",
            "tag": "Sensoriel",
            "link_label": "",
            "show_price": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/onsha-capsules-nomade-quatre-senteurs.jpg"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "b1",
        "b2",
        "b3",
        "b4"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "layout": "scroll",
        "background": "white",
        "align": "center",
        "eyebrow": "Principes actifs",
        "heading": "Ce que contient ta capsule",
        "text": "<p>La liste INCI complète figure sur l'emballage.</p>",
        "columns": 4,
        "columns_mobile": "1",
        "ratio": "1/1",
        "open_first": false
      }
    },
    "ss_faq": {
      "type": "ss-story",
      "blocks": {
        "b3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Puis-je changer de senteur à chaque capsule ?",
            "text": "<p>Bien sûr, c'est tout l'esprit du rituel. La remise par quantité s'applique même si tu mixes les senteurs.</p>",
            "tag": "",
            "link_label": "",
            "show_price": true
          }
        },
        "b4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "La senteur convient-elle aux peaux sensibles ?",
            "text": "<p>Le produit s'utilise diffusé dans l'eau de la douche, en usage externe. Si tu as une sensibilité connue aux parfums ou aux huiles essentielles, consulte la liste INCI sur l'emballage avant utilisation et demande conseil à un professionnel de santé en cas de doute.</p>",
            "tag": "",
            "link_label": "",
            "show_price": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "b3",
        "b4"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "layout": "faq",
        "background": "cream",
        "align": "center",
        "eyebrow": "On répond à tes questions",
        "heading": "Questions fréquentes",
        "text": "",
        "columns": 3,
        "columns_mobile": "1",
        "ratio": "1/1",
        "open_first": true
      }
    },
    "ss_reviews": {
      "type": "ss-reviews",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Avis clientes",
        "open": false
      }
    }
  },
  "order": [
    "breadcrumbs",
    "main",
    "ss_steps",
    "ss_scents",
    "ss_cards",
    "ss_reviews",
    "ss_faq"
  ]
}
